Let a toolchain build the standard library from source for chosen triples

A target's prebuilt standard library is compiled with its default panic
strategy and target features, so rustc flags such as -Cpanic=unwind or
-Ctarget-feature=+atomics on wasm32-unknown-unknown never reach it. A
source_stdlib_triples toolchain attribute puts the named triples on the path
tier 3 triples take, which builds std from the rustc source archive with the
toolchain's flags.

Written to be offered upstream: it is generic, leaves every triple not named
unchanged, and adds no dependency.

License: Apache-2.0 (rules_rs 0.0.112)

